§ Check § Command § Expected
§ embeddings work § `python -m querymesh.embeddings` § dimensions=1024
§ index + pipeline § `curl -s localhost:9200/_search/pipeline/querymesh-rrf | jq 'keys'` § ["querymesh-rrf"]
§ chunks stored § `curl -s localhost:9200/arxiv-chunks/_count | jq .count` § a number above 50
§ hybrid search § `python -m querymesh.search "retrieval augmented generation"` § 5 numbered results with scores around 0.016-0.033
§ PDFs in S3 § `source scripts/use_fakecloud.sh && aws s3 ls s3://querymesh-papers/pdfs/` § at least 3 PDF files
§ Airflow § browser http://localhost:8080 > Dags > querymesh_ingest § unpaused, last run green
You have now built resume line 3 (ingestion: arXiv API, Docling parsing, Airflow DAG scheduling) and resume line 4 (hybrid search: OpenSearch BM25 + Jina embeddings + RRF).
